{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02402",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.19,
      "end_seconds": 5.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.79,
      "end_seconds": 9.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.8,
      "end_seconds": 19.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "Honestly, um, it's no symptoms, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.22,
      "end_seconds": 23.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.33,
      "end_seconds": 31.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "I mean, uh, for six months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.34,
      "end_seconds": 35.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Sure. Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.43,
      "end_seconds": 51.9,
      "duration_seconds": 15.47,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a new partner as well. As for new partner, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.91,
      "end_seconds": 63.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Nothing like rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.54,
      "end_seconds": 68.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Oh, I haven't noticed any rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.6,
      "end_seconds": 75.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Any discharge, sores or burning when passing urine at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.29,
      "end_seconds": 82.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "No discharge, sores or burning when passing urine, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.59,
      "end_seconds": 88.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.83,
      "end_seconds": 91.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Uh, no weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.44,
      "end_seconds": 96.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.63,
      "end_seconds": 104.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "Yes, I had a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.0,
      "end_seconds": 115.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.73,
      "end_seconds": 133.75,
      "duration_seconds": 17.02,
      "text": "Epilepsy, for about a year. I've had eczema for nearly five years now. I've been putting this off for weeks. I didn't want to make a fuss, um, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.83,
      "end_seconds": 147.72,
      "duration_seconds": 7.89,
      "text": "Yes, epilepsy is known to us, good to have that clear. Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.89,
      "end_seconds": 153.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.23,
      "end_seconds": 157.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.77,
      "end_seconds": 164.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream. I take it when needed for the eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.85,
      "end_seconds": 179.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.16,
      "end_seconds": 183.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I mean, my grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.94,
      "end_seconds": 187.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.49,
      "end_seconds": 194.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.47,
      "end_seconds": 197.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.41,
      "end_seconds": 201.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.1,
      "end_seconds": 207.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Okay, what does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.72,
      "end_seconds": 212.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.46,
      "end_seconds": 218.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.67,
      "end_seconds": 234.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Right, bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.79,
      "end_seconds": 261.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 76, BP is 111 over 76, temp 36.5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.62,
      "end_seconds": 268.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.29,
      "end_seconds": 270.27,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.1,
      "end_seconds": 273.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.23,
      "end_seconds": 290.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "There are no visible sores or discharge."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.95,
      "end_seconds": 302.71,
      "duration_seconds": 8.76,
      "text": "Please sit back down. So, based on the history and the examination, this is probably a routine screen with no symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.09,
      "end_seconds": 306.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.28,
      "end_seconds": 334.15,
      "duration_seconds": 26.87,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a routine screen with no symptoms do well once it's treated properly. A urine test for chlamydia and gonorrhoea is what I'd like next, for sexual health screen. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Use condoms with new partners and we will text the results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.42,
      "end_seconds": 346.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "Actually, could I get blood tests for HIV and syphilis done? A friend had it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.94,
      "end_seconds": 356.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.72,
      "text": "I don't think that's needed at this stage, the history doesn't call for it. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.61,
      "end_seconds": 361.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.1,
      "end_seconds": 363.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}